.TH DEPAUDIT 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded d9253c0c" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
depaudit \- Report the latest\-release age of every Go module dependency, from `go list \-m \-json all` on stdin.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B depaudit
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report the latest\-release age of every Go module dependency, from `go list \-m \-json all` on stdin.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-all
report indirect modules too (default: direct only)
.TP
.B \-\-fail\-on\-stale\-direct
exit 1 when a direct module is STALE
.TP
.B \-\-max\-age\-months \fIN\fR
a module whose latest release is older than N months is STALE (default 24)
.TP
.B \-\-proxy \fIURL\fR
module proxy base URL (default https://proxy.golang.org)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXIT STATUS
Exit codes: 0 report printed, 1 a direct module is STALE (with \-\-fail\-on\-stale\-direct)
or a proxy lookup failed, 2 usage error.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
go list \-m \-json all | depaudit
go list \-m \-json all | depaudit \-\-max\-age\-months 36 \-\-fail\-on\-stale\-direct
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
